Data sources used by the city packs
-----------------------------------
- OpenStreetMap: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0,
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright . Used directly (trees in Prague) and
  through Overture Maps layers derived from OSM.
- Overture Maps Foundation (transportation, buildings, base, places):
  https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/ . Layers are published under
  CDLA Permissive 2.0 or ODbL depending on the theme; ODbL layers keep ODbL.
- AWS Terrain Tiles (Mapzen / Registry of Open Data on AWS):
  https://github.com/tilezen/joerd/blob/master/docs/attribution.md .
  New York: USGS 3DEP (public domain). Prague and Tokyo: EU-DEM (Copernicus),
  SRTM and other sources listed in the attribution document above.
- IPR Praha (Prague Institute of Planning and Development), 3D model of buildings
  (CityGML, map sheets Praha 6-1, 6-2, 7-1, 7-2; Mosty 3D), CC BY 4.0, "data base (c) IPR Praha",
  https://www.geoportalpraha.cz/en/data-and-services/open-data . Used for the
  landmark models of Prague (models.pb, specs/models.md).
- MLIT Project PLATEAU, 3D City Model of Tokyo's 23 wards (CityGML, FY2025,
  copyright of the wards of Tokyo), Public Data License 1.0 (PDL 1.0, compatible
  with CC BY 4.0), https://www.mlit.go.jp/plateau/site-policy/ . Used, processed,
  for the landmark models of Tokyo (models.pb, specs/models.md). Attribution:
  出典：国土交通省 PLATEAUウェブサイト（https://www.mlit.go.jp/plateau/open-data/）
  「3D都市モデル（Project PLATEAU）東京都23区」（国土交通省）
  （https://www.geospatial.jp/ckan/dataset/plateau-tokyo23ku）を加工して作成
  (Source: MLIT PLATEAU website; created by processing the 3D city model of
  Tokyo's 23 wards.)
- NYC Parks, 2015 Street Tree Census, NYC Open Data (dataset uvpi-gqnh),
  NYC Open Data terms of use, https://opendata.cityofnewyork.us/overview/#termsofuse .

Each pack also carries its own attribution string (Manifest.attribution) that
the game shows in the About screen.

Generated art
-------------
Images in assets/ were generated with open models listed in assets/LICENSES.md
(Qwen-Image, Apache 2.0; BiRefNet, MIT) or drawn procedurally by tools/art/.
No third-party images were used as input.

No real brands
--------------
Cars, shops, bars and the in-game feed are fictional (rule R10 in
Prompts/00-METROPOLE_PLAN.md). Public institutions and landmarks keep their real
names. Any resemblance of a fictional name to a real product is unintended.
